    "updated_at": "2022-06-14T09:35:09Z",
    "body": "I think it'd be better if this used the existing `Request`'s `render-blocking` boolean. For that, I think you need to pass it with the request itself, and not when finalizing the response. Apologies for not catching that earlier.\r\n\r\n/cc @xiaochengh for thoughts",
